79
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:43,170
The first pathology we'll

80
00:02:43,170 --> 00:02:44,730
talk about is urticaria,

81
00:02:44,730 --> 00:02:46,850
which is commonly
defined as

82
00:02:46,850 --> 00:02:48,810
an intensely pruitic well

83
00:02:48,810 --> 00:02:51,370
